aqua:Fungus a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:BiologicalEntity .
aqua:AquaticFungus a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Fungus .
aqua:Eukaryote a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:BiologicalEntity .
aqua:Protist a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Eukaryote .
aqua:MicrobialCommunity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:BiologicalEntity .
aqua:AquiferMicrobiome a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:MicrobialCommunity .
aqua:SoilMicrobiome a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:MicrobialCommunity .
aqua:MarineMicrobialCommunity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:MicrobialCommunity .
aqua:FunctionalGuild a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:MicrobialCommunity .
aqua:AutotrophicGuild a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:FunctionalGuild .
aqua:HeterotrophicGuild a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:FunctionalGuild .
aqua:CO2FixationGuild a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:AutotrophicGuild .
aqua:AnoxicGuild a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:FunctionalGuild .
aqua:OxicGuild a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:FunctionalGuild .
aqua:EnvironmentalIndicatorGuild a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:FunctionalGuild .

aqua:Habitat a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:PhysicalEntity .
aqua:SubsurfaceHabitat a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Habitat .
aqua:AbovegroundHabitat a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Habitat .
aqua:OxicZone a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:SubsurfaceHabitat .
aqua:AnoxicZone a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:SubsurfaceHabitat .

aqua:Process a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Entity .
aqua:BiogeochemicalProcess a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Process .
aqua:GeochemicalProcess a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:BiogeochemicalProcess .
aqua:HydrologicalProcess a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Process .
aqua:Recharge a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:HydrologicalProcess .
aqua:GroundwaterSupply a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:HydrologicalProcess .
aqua:GroundwaterFlow a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:HydrologicalProcess .
aqua:TransportProcess a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:HydrologicalProcess .
aqua:ContaminantTransport a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:TransportProcess .
aqua:MicrobialTransport a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:TransportProcess .
aqua:Karstification a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:GeochemicalProcess .
aqua:CarbonateDissolution a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:GeochemicalProcess .
aqua:MineralOrganicInteraction a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:GeochemicalProcess .
aqua:CO2FixationProcess a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:BiogeochemicalProcess .
aqua:Biodegradation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:BiogeochemicalProcess .
aqua:NutrientCycling a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:BiogeochemicalProcess .
aqua:SubstrateUtilization a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:BiogeochemicalProcess .
aqua:MicrobialActivity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:BiogeochemicalProcess .
aqua:CommunityInteraction a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Process .
aqua:CrossKingdomInteraction a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:CommunityInteraction .

aqua:Observation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:InformationEntity .
aqua:SamplingMethod a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Observation .
aqua:Sample a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:InformationEntity .
aqua:MonitoringEvent a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Observation .
aqua:TemporalDynamics a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Observation .
aqua:SpatialDistribution a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:Observation .
aqua:VulnerabilityAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:InformationEntity .
aqua:GroundwaterQuality a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf aqua:InformationEntity .

